  "behavior": [
    "First requester, conversation creator and actual original Matrix room creator remain distinct. Exact original unbound/bound conversation cannot silently start SPACE replacement history.",
    "Five-minute request, eight attempts, sixty-second leases, eight rows per claim, sixteen active leases. Exact captured native/device/provider generation and worker/revision/token fences.",
    "Worker binding and exact successful request must commit together, enforced in both directions with deferred commit validation. Immutable original room coordinate retained.",
    "Both owned participants retain safe status/binding metadata after parent purge. Queue native/device/provider proof remains requester/worker-only. Restricted view owner has column privileges only.",
    "Typed insertion, retry and binding publication require exact readback. Missing/malformed/foreign results, failed Result, cancellation and interruption roll back actual PostgreSQL writes. Claims reject bounds before I/O and bad claim readback rolls back attempts/lease.",
